# This layer does not use terraform.tfvars.
#
# Region and org_prefix come from ../config.yaml; the namespace, service account
# and queue prefixes from ./config.yaml. Both are committed. The cluster's OIDC
# issuer is read live from the cluster, so there is nothing else to configure.
#
# One value is not committed, because it carries the account id. Supply it from
# the gitignored ../.env:
#
#   source ../.env
#   terraform plan
#
# ../.env should contain:
#
#   export TF_VAR_account_id=REPLACE-WORKLOAD-ACCOUNT-ID
#
# A terraform.tfvars here would be auto-loaded and silently override the config
# above, so this file is kept as a pointer only.
